../README.md-160-
../README.md-161-## How it works
../README.md-162-
../README.md-163-slag runs a 4-phase pipeline:
../README.md-164-
../README.md-165-```
../README.md:166:PRD.md --> SURVEYOR --> BLUEPRINT.md --> FOUNDER --> PLAN.md --> FORGE --> PROGRESS.md
../README.md-167- (ore)    (analyze)    (analysis)      (design)   (ingots)   (strike)    (ledger)
../README.md-168-```
../README.md-169-
../README.md:170:### Phase 1: SURVEYOR
../README.md-171-
../README.md-172-Reads your `PRD.md` (the ore) and produces `BLUEPRINT.md`, a deep analysis with architecture decisions, dependency graph, risk assessment, and forging sequence. Runs on the plan model.
../README.md-173-
../README.md-174-### Phase 2: FOUNDER
../README.md-175-
../README.md-176-Reads the blueprint and casts S-expression ingots into `PLAN.md`. Each ingot is a single task:
--
../README.md-197-### Phase 4: ASSAY
../README.md-198-
../README.md-199-Final report. Counts forged versus cracked ingots, shows a temperature bar, and exits 0 on a full forge or 1 if anything cracked. It prints on failed runs too, since a run that cracked an ingot is when you most need the cracked list.
