src/pipeline/fix.rs-1-//! `slag fix`: solve one issue in an existing repository, fast, and prove it.
src/pipeline/fix.rs-2-//!
src/pipeline/fix.rs:3://! The commission pipeline (survey, found, forge, assay) builds a project
src/pipeline/fix.rs-4-//! from nothing. An issue in a repository that already has code and tests
src/pipeline/fix.rs-5-//! needs none of that ceremony, and the ingot machinery would write PRD,
