../README.md-128-With another provider selected, bare `openrouter/auto` uses that provider's default. Use `openrouter::openrouter/auto` to request OpenRouter routing.
../README.md-129-
../README.md:130:Provider settings join the existing model, duel, screenshot, MCP, and spend settings in the same file. OpenRouter keeps its routing, `reasoning_details` replay, pricing lookup, and attribution headers. slag preserves native DeepSeek `reasoning_content` and Gemini tool signatures across tool calls. The agent recovers standalone JSON against declared tool schemas and rejects prose or code fences. It returns provider tool-validation errors to the model, with a limit of three consecutive failures. Other providers receive supported reasoning fields or omit them.
